# DeskConvert Environment Variables
#
# DeskConvert runs 100% locally (in-browser WebAssembly on Vercel, or native
# Python/WebView2 on Windows Desktop). No API keys, database URLs, OAuth
# credentials, or server-side secrets are required to build or run this app.
#
# Optional build/dev overrides (none required):
# VITE_APP_VERSION=2.0.0
# PYWEBVIEW_LOG=INFO
